    <string name="ntfy_test_failed">The test didn\'t go through. Check that the address is reachable from this phone.</string>
    <string name="ntfy_setup">Set up Paperless</string>
    <string name="ntfy_steps">1. In Paperless, open Workflows and add one.\n2. Trigger: Document Added (and, if you like, Document Updated).\n3. Action: Webhook. URL: PaperCtrl\'s push address above. Turn on “Send as JSON” and leave “Use parameters” off.\n4. Body: paste the text below.\n5. Save. The next document Paperless adds shows up as a notification.</string>
    <string name="ntfy_body">Webhook body</string>
    <string name="ntfy_internal_note">If your ntfy server is on your home network, Paperless may block webhooks to local addresses: set PAPERLESS_WEBHOOKS_ALLOW_INTERNAL_REQUESTS=true on the server, or use ntfy\'s public HTTPS address.</string>
